00:00:19.734 --> 00:00:22.167
Academy Award winner. Love, you've changed already.

00:00:22.167 --> 00:00:24.367
Look. The afro's now slicked back.

00:00:24.367 --> 00:00:26.100
[ Laughter ] He changed.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:29.400
He's -- Now you're speaking in Eastern standard dialect.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.267
"I am a serious performer now.

00:00:32.267 --> 00:00:35.667
My name now is Amir K. Thompson.

