00:00:39.534 --> 00:00:40.901
Black Thought, you are --

00:00:40.901 --> 00:00:42.300
Tariq, you are no longer Black Thought.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.934
You are Negro Contemplation."

00:00:44.934 --> 00:00:47.033
