00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:37.234
I was like, "Alright." -No, yeah.

00:01:37.234 --> 00:01:40.033
-It's on you, brother. It's on you.

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:41.267
-I was going to ask you,

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:42.868
does that mean anything to you, 4/20?

00:01:42.868 --> 00:01:44.367
-Um, it does.

00:01:44.367 --> 00:01:47.934
Not -- It don't mean as much as it does Snoop Dogg, but --

00:01:47.934 --> 00:01:49.133
-Yeah. -He's probably crying.

00:01:49.133 --> 00:01:51.434
He's taking the month off.

00:01:51.434 --> 00:01:53.133
-Exactly. Right.

00:01:53.133 --> 00:01:55.634
-But it means, like, for me, I --

00:01:55.634 --> 00:01:58.701
It's fun. I'm just not good at it.

00:01:58.701 --> 00:02:01.501
Like, some people are good at smoking weed. I'm not.

00:02:01.501 --> 00:02:03.734
Last time I got high was at a barbecue --

00:02:03.734 --> 00:02:05.167
I have allergic reactions to it.

00:02:05.167 --> 00:02:07.133
I got high at a barbecue at my house,

00:02:07.133 --> 00:02:09.100
and I thought I was Spider-Man.

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:13.334
I was literally going around my house, going, "Pshew!"

00:02:13.334 --> 00:02:17.100
And I seen the web, and I would jump and stick on the wall.

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:18.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.601 --> 00:02:22.033
And I did this all around my house for, like, four hours.

00:02:22.033 --> 00:02:24.067
And people was like -- And after that, they was like,

00:02:24.067 --> 00:02:26.133
"Marlon -- No more weed for Marlon."

00:02:26.133 --> 00:02:28.534
-People would rather give me rack than weed.

00:02:28.534 --> 00:02:30.834
That'd be an easier high for me.

00:02:30.834 --> 00:02:34.434
-They -- You've played -- You've won a Stony Award.

00:02:34.434 --> 00:02:36.200
-I've won multiple weedhead awards.

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:38.467
I'm really good at playing weedheads.

00:02:38.467 --> 00:02:40.133
I studied them. Here's what happened.

00:02:40.133 --> 00:02:42.200
-Yeah, tell me. -I'm a method actor, so...

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:44.000
-Okay. -Instead of me smoking it --

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:46.133
'Cause when you smoke, I forget everything I do.

00:02:46.133 --> 00:02:48.234
It'd be real funny, but I forget what the hell I did.

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:50.067
One time I got high and I wrote what I --

00:02:50.067 --> 00:02:52.033
I was like, "I'm gonna beat -- I'm-a write myself down --

00:02:52.033 --> 00:02:53.601
write down what I did." -Yeah.

00:02:53.601 --> 00:02:55.067
-And I wrote it down.

00:02:55.067 --> 00:02:57.434
And I -- It was like my third-grade handwriting.

00:02:57.434 --> 00:02:59.234
I didn't know -- I couldn't read --

00:02:59.234 --> 00:03:00.701
-What you wrote down.

00:03:00.701 --> 00:03:03.501
-So, I learned, let me get my friends high.

00:03:03.501 --> 00:03:05.667
I would get big bags of weed, and I would get them high.

00:03:05.667 --> 00:03:08.701
And I would just watch them... and take notes.

00:03:08.701 --> 00:03:10.434
And then I -- -They must have loved that.

00:03:10.434 --> 00:03:13.133
-Yeah. And I did 'em in movies. -They're paranoid enough.

00:03:13.133 --> 00:03:15.701
-So, I did one of my boys, Shorty. "Scary Movie."

00:03:15.701 --> 00:03:17.501
-That's right. -He's a real dude, right?

00:03:17.501 --> 00:03:19.534
And he wanted to sue me.

00:03:19.534 --> 00:03:21.300
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.701
He rolled up -- Literally sue me.

00:03:23.701 --> 00:03:27.300
"Son, I'm suing you for character defecation!"

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:30.968
I was like, "First of all, you mean 'defamation.'"

00:03:30.968 --> 00:03:34.267
"No, son, I said 'defecation' 'cause you [bleep] on me!"

00:03:34.267 --> 00:03:36.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:39.400
And I was like -- I was like, "What do you mean?"

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:42.267
He was like, "I seened -- I seened -- it's seenedet."

00:03:42.267 --> 00:03:46.601
Seenedet. The past sense of seened, stupid

00:03:46.601 --> 00:03:50.734
I seened you do me in that movie, 'Requiem for a Dream.'"

00:03:50.734 --> 00:03:52.667
I said, "Dude, I didn't do you in 'Requiem for a Dream.'

00:03:52.667 --> 00:03:53.868
I did you in 'Scary Movie.'"

00:03:53.868 --> 00:03:55.334
He goes, "Ahh!

00:03:55.334 --> 00:03:57.968
Snap, son! That's my joint right there!

00:03:57.968 --> 00:04:01.901
You should have won an Emmy, a Grammy for that."

00:04:01.901 --> 00:04:05.234
-Should've won a Grammy for that movie.

00:04:05.234 --> 00:04:07.534
You know, last time, I think we talked about --

00:04:07.534 --> 00:04:09.501
or one of the times -- we talked about taking vitamins.

00:04:09.501 --> 00:04:11.033
'Cause you always -- you look so young --

00:04:11.033 --> 00:04:12.167
-Thank you. -And you take --

00:04:12.167 --> 00:04:13.467
