00:04:13.467 --> 00:04:15.634
-I take everything. I take --

00:04:15.634 --> 00:04:20.534
See, shorty would tell you, "Weed has nutrients."

00:04:20.534 --> 00:04:22.934
It does. It got vitamins and nutrients.

00:04:22.934 --> 00:04:26.000
It got vitamins T, C, and H...

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:27.467
[ Laughter ]

00:04:27.467 --> 00:04:29.167
...and C, B, and D."

00:04:29.167 --> 00:04:30.567
-Yeah, that's right, yeah.

00:04:30.567 --> 00:04:32.167
-So, I do -- I do take a lot of vitamins.

00:04:32.167 --> 00:04:33.734
But I just -- I don't know -- I just --

00:04:33.734 --> 00:04:36.300
it took me a long time. I'm just developing weird.

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:38.501
Like, I just now got a chest.

00:04:38.501 --> 00:04:40.133
-You got one this year?

00:04:40.133 --> 00:04:42.234
-Yeah, it's a weird feeling to actually have a chest.

00:04:42.234 --> 00:04:43.767
