00:04:47.567 --> 00:04:49.434
It's like she got grip.

00:04:49.434 --> 00:04:51.567
[ Laughter ]

00:04:51.567 --> 00:04:52.934
-Sliding down.

00:04:52.934 --> 00:04:55.100
-Yeah. Now I can finally grow a beard.

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:56.934
It's not all -- My beard used to grow like

00:04:56.934 --> 00:04:58.968
