00:05:02.234 --> 00:05:05.367
Like, now I'm ready for, like, leading man or stuff like that.

00:05:05.367 --> 00:05:06.901
I couldn't do that when I was younger.

00:05:06.901 --> 00:05:08.634
-Yeah, you could -- You always had a good look.

00:05:08.634 --> 00:05:10.033
I mean, you always had a young face.

00:05:10.033 --> 00:05:12.334
-I was cute, but, you know, I'm trying to get that --

00:05:12.334 --> 00:05:13.968
You know, I gotta -- Feel that, Jimmy.

00:05:13.968 --> 00:05:15.434
This -- I wear my suits tight now.

00:05:15.434 --> 00:05:17.234
Come on. -Yeah, you do. Exactly.

00:05:17.234 --> 00:05:19.100
Don't mess with Marlon Wayans, man. Come on.

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:20.934
-I wear my suits tight. -Yeah.

00:05:20.934 --> 00:05:22.601
I mean, you always look young.

00:05:22.601 --> 00:05:25.434
