Dude, I've been around since the '40s."

00:05:31.033 --> 00:05:32.934
I'm old as hell. But you know what?

00:05:32.934 --> 00:05:35.734
I have the exact opposite of -- I'm always going to look young.

00:05:35.734 --> 00:05:36.901
That's a good thing. -Yep.

00:05:36.901 --> 00:05:38.434
-There's some people that don't have that.

00:05:38.434 --> 00:05:42.801
Like, Morgan Freeman has looked old for, like, 60 years.

00:05:42.801 --> 00:05:46.133
So neither one of us are aging. You know what I mean?

00:05:46.133 --> 00:05:48.634
[ Laughter ] -He just looks that age.

00:05:48.634 --> 00:05:50.634
