I was like, "What?" -That's a great --

00:08:25.868 --> 00:08:27.968
-I damn near got booed that night.

00:08:27.968 --> 00:08:30.000
So, the next night, they was like, "This is funny.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.367
We gonna do it again."

00:08:31.367 --> 00:08:32.901
So they do the same thing.

00:08:32.901 --> 00:08:35.501
But I had prepared my closer set.

00:08:35.501 --> 00:08:37.000
-Wow. -And so I went out and I --

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:38.400
I did an hour.

00:08:38.400 --> 00:08:40.267
And I brought the audience back up and I destroyed.

00:08:40.267 --> 00:08:41.467
-Yeah. -And then my crazy brother --

00:08:41.467 --> 00:08:44.534
This is Damon. "Mm. I'm closing tomorrow."

00:08:44.534 --> 00:08:45.901
[ Laughter ] -Exactly.

00:08:45.901 --> 00:08:47.734
Once you learn your lesson, like,

00:08:47.734 --> 00:08:49.901
"Dude, get out of the way." Exactly. Little brother, yeah.

00:08:49.901 --> 00:08:51.801
I want to show everyone a clip from your special.

